OL,3,GNEWSAPension tops #16,000 a year after
OL,4,A4.7% increase
OL,5,
OL,6,FJersey pensioners are to receive an
OL,7,Fincrease of #734 a year to their old
OL,8,Fage pension as a top-up comes into
OL,9,Feffect.
OL,11,FThe Government of Jersey said the 4.7%
OL,12,Fincrease, an additional #14 per week
OL,13,Ffor someone on a full pension, would
OL,14,Fbring the overall sum to #16,294 per
OL,15,Fyear.
OL,17,FThe pension is updated every October by
OL,18,Fat least the recorded increase in the
OL,19,Fpensioner retail price index for June.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
