OL,3,GNEWSAPension tops #16,000 a year after
OL,4,A4.7% increase
OL,5,
OL,6,FMinister for Social Security Senator
OL,7,FElaine Millar said further support,
OL,8,Fincluding cold weather payments and
OL,9,Ffree TV licences, would be available
OL,10,Ffor those on low incomes.
